From c972254355b35ed378b6c3537e49b27f7446f59e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MaySoMusician <maysomusician@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Sep 2025 15:03:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Introduce more detailed non-streaming response
 converter

e.g. handling url_citations
---
